{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y90nupkv","slide":1,"text":"[Sources]\n- User-provided AI Use Case Template V1.1_CatalogManagement.pptx (structure, owners, scoring rubric).\n- User direction: insourced use; Windchill; Philips Product Library; quoting tools.\n- Local IGT Systems Sales Text Engine project: 3,778 embedded catalogue items; local search; guided short/long draft creation; no external AI/API.\n[/Sources]\n\nValidation needed before approval: source-system access and ownership, user count, baseline cycle time, KPI targets, portfolio reuse check, production hosting/security, and write-back governance.\nRecommended next step: confirm data owners and access, run a controlled pilot, measure baseline/target KPIs, then decide production integration sequence."}
